{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"32ac8a0faa64001bbe72e626caba31fc37c75b5f9f0a89c128feb0655adefe03","slug":"computation-evidence","location":"/foundations/computation-evidence.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"计算证据：电脑算出来，为什么还要问“怎么算的”？","content_includes_title":false,"authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"上海市怒江中学怒江战队","family":"上海市怒江中学怒江战队"},"name":"上海市怒江中学怒江战队","id":"contributors-Users\\limen\\Documents\\Antigravity\\math-exhibition-independent-rerun\\competition\\learning-book\\myst-generated-uid-0"}],"keywords":["数学学术展评","初中数学","机器人避障","图论","Jupyter Book"],"numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"computation-evidence.md","url":"/nujiang-math-exhibition-book/build/computation-evidence-624b03e3796d16311002ab1f0815bcd0.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"两道题都会用到程序：题一要追踪运动与距离，题二要在大量图中寻找最优。电脑可以迅速处理人手难以完成的计算，但运行得快或运行得久都不是证明。要把输出变成研究证据，必须说明程序检查了什么范围、怎样处理误差、是否证明了最优，以及别人能否独立复核。","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"mDsGHL21K0"}],"key":"YIJehxYpB5"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"四种常见计算任务","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"w6h3YtrxJ9"}],"identifier":"id","label":"四种常见计算任务","html_id":"id","implicit":true,"key":"JHBvbQbtWf"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"模拟：沿着一套方案看看会发生什么","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"tG9Y7jtDjn"}],"identifier":"id","label":"模拟：沿着一套方案看看会发生什么","html_id":"id-1","implicit":true,"key":"CPL6eBA3nr"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"给定一套机器人动作，程序按时间推进，画出轨迹并估计最小距离。模拟擅长发现危险时刻和帮助理解，但若只每隔一小段时间采样，可能漏掉两个采样点之间的碰撞。","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"QiyOmDkTgN"}],"key":"BKmGcKGdxm"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"搜索：在许多候选中寻找可行方案","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"zTDNvBVa0e"}],"identifier":"id","label":"搜索：在许多候选中寻找可行方案","html_id":"id-2","implicit":true,"key":"jmSCVXGVZK"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"程序在许多卡片序列中寻找一个可行方案。找到了，就可以把方案拿出来复核；没找到，除非确认搜索空间已经完整覆盖，否则不能推出不存在。","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"w6aUeftwIb"}],"key":"kTsF2yS3B2"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"穷举或整数优化：把所有离散可能纳入范围","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"i9OwuMrNGj"}],"identifier":"id","label":"穷举或整数优化：把所有离散可能纳入范围","html_id":"id-3","implicit":true,"key":"WdDrTPIDQN"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"穷举","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"key":"BIWu7X686B"}],"key":"dJGgVkla3O"},{"type":"text","value":"是逐一检查一个有限范围内的所有可能。范围太大时，可以用整数优化把每条可能的边记成0或1，让求解器在全部组合中寻找最优值。若求解器证明了“再少一条边不可能”，并输出可检查的状态，才构成精确结论的一部分。","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"key":"aAfMN6lLN1"}],"key":"zqOSQTBeUh"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"证书验证：把复杂过程压成容易复查的结果","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"key":"QSSstuAut7"}],"identifier":"id","label":"证书验证：把复杂过程压成容易复查的结果","html_id":"id-4","implicit":true,"key":"KpMXnlbsMz"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"证书像一张可独立验票的车票。求解过程可以很复杂，但最终见证通常很简单：一组边、一套卡片、一个区间分割列表。另一段独立程序不必重复原搜索，只需检查这个见证是否满足所有规则。","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"BV58Rnu540"}],"key":"vfoB3IZYsq"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"浮点数为什么需要特别小心","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"key":"xTJ9rmDBsZ"}],"identifier":"id","label":"浮点数为什么需要特别小心","html_id":"id-5","implicit":true,"key":"AAqNevYaCc"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"计算机不能精确存下所有小数。例如 ","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"key":"UrSNZ3C7rj"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"0.1+0.2","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1+0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span></span></span></span>","key":"QoTbrSWQxL"},{"type":"text","value":" 在二进制浮点中可能得到非常接近 0.3、但不完全相等的数。当安全边界刚好是 9，而计算结果只比 9 大百万分之一时，普通绘图或稀